cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "jqe, an engine for Jieqi"
abstract: >-
  An alpha-beta engine for Jieqi, the variant of xiangqi in which every piece but the general
  starts face down on a random deal, with chance nodes for face-down moves and a small NNUE
  network trained on its own games; an independent rules referee; and the records of its
  matches against other Jieqi engines, with the scripts that recompute every result from them.
authors:
  - family-names: "O'Keefe"
    given-names: "Devin"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-13
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/devinokeefe/jieqi"
keywords:
  - jieqi
  - xiangqi
  - game engine
  - alpha-beta search
  - NNUE
